    Tests for HTTP request body size enforcement:
    - Content-Length pre-check (HTTP/1.1)
    - Chunked transfer encoding body size limit (HTTP/1.1)
    - HTTP/2 DATA frame body size limit
    - WebSocket message size limit
    - Server-level and listener-level configuration
